        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(oauth): pass workspace context to resolveProviderIdForAuth on refresh failure",
        "body": "> [!NOTE]\n> **AI-Assisted Contribution:** This PR was prepared and validated with the assistance of an AI coding assistant (Antigravity/Gemini).\n\n## What Problem This Solves\n\nResolves a problem where aliased provider lookup fails to resolve workspace-scoped aliases on oauth token refresh failures (pr #100841).\n\n**Symptom/Behavior:**\nLine 471 calls `resolveProviderIdForAuth(cred.provider)` with only one argument, omitting the configuration and workspace directory parameters. This causes `resolveProviderAuthAliasMap` to be called with `undefined` parameters, resulting in failure to resolve workspace-scoped provider aliases and failure to delete/clear the incorrect profile ID from `snapshot.lastGood`.\n\nAffected location: `[src/agents/auth-profiles/oauth.ts](file://src/agents/auth-profiles/oauth.ts#L471) (compiled as `dist/oauth-R_OaG_Ep.js` inside `catch (error)` block)`\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nImplemented a surgical fix to resolve the logic discrepancy.\n\n**Solution Overview:**\nPass the full parameters (context/config) to `resolveProviderIdForAuth`:\n  ```javascript\n  const providerKey = resolveProviderIdForAuth(cred.provider, {\n      config: cfg,\n      workspaceDir: params.workspaceDir\n  });\n  ```\n\n## User Impact\n\nCorrects behavior to ensure that: When clearing the last good profile on OAuth refresh failures, the aliased provider ID should be resolved using the full workspace configuration (`cfg` and `workspaceDir`) to ensure workspace-scoped aliases/plugins are correctly respected.\n\n### Unit Tests / Verification Suite\n- Completed workspaceDir threading to all OAuth profile resolution and refresh paths (including plugin-sdk, cli-runner, and agents resolution paths).\n- Reproduction/regression unit tests in `src/agents/auth-profiles/repro_1_4.test.ts`, `src/plugin-sdk/provider-auth.test.ts`, and `src/agents/cli-runner/prepare.test.ts` pass successfully.\n\n### Real Behavior Proof\n\n#### Passing Verification:\n```text\n[test] starting test/vitest/vitest.unit-fast.config.ts\nThe `envFile` option is deprecated, please use `envDir: false` instead.\n\n RUN  v4.1.9 /home/dietpi/Developer/openclaw\n\n ✓ |unit-fast| src/agents/auth-profiles/oauth-refresh-failure.test.ts (6 tests) 4ms\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  6 passed (6)\n   Start at  12:29:36\n   Duration  255ms (transform 84ms, setup 58ms, import 48ms, tests 4ms, environment 0ms)\n\n[test] starting test/vitest/vitest.plugin-sdk.config.ts\nThe `envFile` option is deprecated, please use `envDir: false` instead.\n\n RUN  v4.1.9 /home/dietpi/Developer/openclaw\n\n ✓ |plugin-sdk| src/plugin-sdk/provider-auth.test.ts (8 tests) 4055ms\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  8 passed (8)\n   Start at  12:29:39\n   Duration  4.61s (transform 2.94s, setup 382ms, import 14ms, tests 4.05s, environment 0ms)\n\n[test] starting test/vitest/vitest.agents.config.ts\nThe `envFile` option is deprecated, please use `envDir: false` instead.\n\n RUN  v4.1.9 /home/dietpi/Developer/openclaw\n\n ✓ |agents| src/agents/cli-runner/prepare.test.ts (64 tests) 1402ms\n ✓ |agents| src/agents/auth-profiles/repro_1_4.test.ts (1 test) 228ms\n\n Test Files  2 passed (2)\n      Tests  65 passed (65)\n```\n",
        "branch": "fix/1.4-oauth-resolve-provider-with-workspace",
